      "text": "20 feet. After the dragon uses their Poison Breath, a cloud of poison gas continues to emanate from their body for 1 round. Any creature that ends its turn in the miasma takes 6d6 poison damage (DC 43 basic Fortitude save save).\n\nAny creature in the miasma is Concealed and treats other creatures as concealed. The dragon can see through this concealment.\n\nEffect: Miasma",
